    "body": "This looks like whatever mode the terminal is in does not support ANSI escape sequences.\r\n\r\nWhen I try this, just smacking 'ENTER' once seems to reset the terminal. Is that the case for you as well or does it persist? This also can't be solved purely from within starship, since we don't implement ANSI escape interpretation (that's the responsibility of the layers above starship).",
